# G1 damage rules (Agent B): LegenDoom 3.0 numbers. Every key is read from LegenDoom's pk3 (line by line).
# effect     key        file                                   state label / re   call / regex      arg / nth
#
# Comrade: (5 * random(1, 3)) * CallACS("PlayerCount") -- no constant (Shotgun.dec FireComrade); x players in game.
# Thematic: 5 * random(1, 3) * CallACS("LDEffectCount", EFFECT_THEMATIC) -- no constant (Shotgun.dec FireThematic).
#
# NanoCircuit: A_Jump(174, 1) jumps INTO the bonus states (the Goto is not a state): a bonus with chance 174/256 per pull
NanoCircuit  chance     decorate/Shotgun/Shotgun.dec           FireNanoCircuit    A_Jump            0
#
# Marksman: the maximum of LegenDoom's roll: shotgun 15 per pellet = 5 * 3 (FBF_NORANDOM); rocket 160 = 20 * 8
Marksman     dmg        decorate/Shotgun/Shotgun.dec           FireMarksman       A_FireBullets     3
# LegenDoom's normal shotgun pellet: 5 x random(1,3) (no FBF_NORANDOM): base 5, average 10 (Q13 b)
Marksman     normal     decorate/Shotgun/Shotgun.dec           NormalFire         A_FireBullets     3
Marksman     rocket     decorate/RareSpecialEffects.dec        re  "^\s*Damage \((\d+)\)\s*$"  4
#
# Decaying: random(1, 30) per pull on the shotgun (twice its max roll 15); rocket random(1,320), BFG random(1,1600)
Decaying     hi         decorate/Shotgun/Shotgun.dec           re  "A_FireBullets \(5\.6, 0, 7, random\(1,(\d+)\)"  1
Decaying     rocket_hi  decorate/RareSpecialEffects.dec        re  "Damage \(random\(1,(\d+)\)\)"  1
#
# Favoured: (50 - (CallACS("LDFavouredCount") * 5)) * random(1, 3) per pellet; LDFavouredCount = LD weapons owned
Favoured     base       decorate/Shotgun/Shotgun.dec           re  "A_FireBullets \(5\.6, 0, 7, \((\d+) - \(CallACS\(.LDFavouredCount.\)"  1
Favoured     per        decorate/Shotgun/Shotgun.dec           re  "LDFavouredCount.\) \* (\d+)\)\)"  1
Favoured     normal     decorate/Shotgun/Shotgun.dec           NormalFire         A_FireBullets     3
Favoured     weapons    source/LEGENDINF.acs                   re  "#define WEAPON_MAX\s+(\d+)"  1
#
# Convincing: LegenDoom's own token items are given (LDConvincingEffect 30 tokens, ...Berserk 400, ...Plasma 80,
# ...BFG 1600); the two radius gives are LegenDoom's A_RadiusGive radii:
Convincing   rocket_r   decorate/EpicSpecialEffects.dec        re  "A_RadiusGive \(.LDConvincingEffectRocket., (\d+)"  1
Convincing   bfg_r      decorate/EpicSpecialEffects.dec        re  "A_RadiusGive \(.LDConvincingEffectBFGTracer., (\d+)"  1
Convincing   tokens     decorate/EpicSpecialEffects.dec        LDConvincingEffect/GiveTokens  A_GiveInventory  1
